cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it."
title: "Qwen-Seis-Posttrain: SFT and multi-task RL of Qwen3.5-9B for seismology on a GPU cluster"
abstract: >-
  Supervised fine-tuning on teacher-written, solver-checked data and multi-task
  GRPO-style reinforcement learning (numeric, code, judged reports, general
  instructions) of Qwen3.5-9B for seismology, run in one month on a shared
  Slurm cluster (8 nodes of 3 x A100-40GB). Includes the evaluation contract
  (test sets frozen before training, a measured noise floor, two judges), the
  data pipeline (verification, difficulty audit, decontamination), the memory
  and runtime fixes needed to train a 9B model on 40 GB GPUs, and a failure
  atlas of what went wrong and how each failure is now caught.
